<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hazelton year net loss A$2.46 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hazelton year net loss A$2.46 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.51 vs 0.92</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 2.46 vs loss 2.35</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     2.00 vs 3.00</p>
<p>    Sales				   57.76 vs 54.54</p>
<p>    Other income			   1.35 vs 1.12</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 14.5 vs loss 13.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 5.28 vs loss 4.09</p>
<p>    Tax			     credit 1.31 vs credit 0.82</p>
<p>    Interest				 2.46 vs 1.55</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   2.13 vs 2.63</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Hazelton Airlines Ltd is a regional airline and is about 33 percent owned by interests associated with founder Max Hazelton.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
